mn95:9.28 starts: and guests should be honoured, respected, revered,
mn95:15.7 starts: “If a person approves of something…if he receives
mn95:15.8 none
mn95:24.4 starts: If one does not apply one’s will, one
mn95:24.5 starts: but because one applies one’s will, one scrutinises.
mn95:30.5 starts: but because one gives ear, one hears the Dhamma.
mn95:30.6 starts: That is why giving ear is most helpful
mn95:31.4 starts: If one does not pay respect,
mn95:31.5 starts: but because one pays respect, one gives ear.
mn95:31.6 starts: That is why paying respect is most helpful
